              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reference Number: 100451"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Name]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Alger"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Gender]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Male"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Infection History]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A member of the third mining team. Long-term exposure to Geomarrow crystals, crystalline dust, and noise."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Symptoms]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Dyspnea, accompanied by nasal obstruction, hemoptysis, chest pains, and pulmonary dysfunction. Difficulty lying down and edema of lower limbs."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Hearing loss, severe tinnitus, occasional auditory hallucinations, and severe insomnia."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. The patient's emotional regulation function is damaged. Hard to stabilize the patient's mental state. Frequent episodes of anger, impulsion, and depression."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Doctor's Advice]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The patient has been mining Geomarrow for over five consecutive years and has severe symptoms of pneumoconiosis."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It is suspected that he failed to strictly follow safety protocols, which exposed his respiratory tract to working environment and caused infection. His physical condition will make it impossible for him to continue working in the mines."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Doctor] (Signature):"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Natasha"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Appendix]:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggest thoroughly inspecting the safety and quality of the protective equipment."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
